{
  "id": "KG-2026-11-09-a",
  "title": "Avika ki live location",
  "format": "Map journey: live location vs the late friend, Housie table to front door",
  "idea": "Avika is bringing the gajar ka halwa and swears she is 5 minutes away, but her live location goes everywhere except the kitty.",
  "logline": "Avika swears she is 5 minutes away with the halwa, the gang watches her live location stop at a petrol pump, a parlour and the sabzi mandi, and she walks in with raw halwa in a pressure cooker.",
  "game": "every excuse Avika gives on the phone is busted by her live location dot",
  "experiment": {
    "type": "map-journey",
    "hook": "Housie running, Tanya shouts into the phone \"Avika! Halwa kahan?!\" and Avika answers \"Paanch minute! Gate pe hoon!\" then a hard cut to the live map with her dot sitting on her own house",
    "variable": "the first map-journey reel: a live location dot that moves to a new labelled stop every shot (Ghar, Petrol pump, Parlour, Sabzi mandi, Kitty) cut against the gang reacting, to test whether a moving dot plus busted excuses holds the middle like the door-arrivals doorbell does",
    "hypothesis": "a new stop every 3 to 4 s keeps skip under 40% and watched above 45%, and the \"Tag your Avika\" caption gets 3+ shares because every group has a late friend with a live location"
  },
  "mute": [
    "Housie running at Tanya's, she shouts into her phone, chip AVIKA: \"5 MINUTE!\", clock 5:00",
    "a live map, the dot sits on Avika's house, chip LIVE LOCATION: AVIKA KA GHAR, so the gate excuse is a lie",
    "Tanya on the phone again, chip HALWA: AVIKA KE PAAS: Avika has the halwa and the gang wants it",
    "the dot moves to a petrol pump, chip STOP 1, the traffic excuse is busted",
    "the dot moves to a parlour with a mirror and lipstick, chip STOP 2: GLOW PARLOUR, busted again",
    "Tanya smiles and checks, chip HALWA: READY?, the gang still hopes",
    "music cuts, the dot stops at the sabzi mandi, chip STOP 3: SABZI MANDI, everyone shouts GAJAR?!",
    "Tanya panics, Ruhi laughs, chip HALWA: ABHI GAJAR HAI, the halwa is not even made",
    "the dot finally reaches the kitty, chip AVIKA PAHUNCH GAYI!, doorbell",
    "Avika in the doorway, a pressure cooker pops up next to her, chip HALWA: ?, the halwa is still cooking",
    "clock now 8:45, Shruti flat-faced asks Ab?, Avika with the cooker smiles and says the same 5 minute line, chip back to the opening AVIKA: \"5 MINUTE!\"",
    "the whole gang shouts PAANCH MINUTE?! at her, same chip as the opening, freeze"
  ],
  "beats": "hook: Halwa kahan? / Paanch minute, gate pe hoon / map: dot at her own house / esc: petrol pump traffic, parlour signal, sabzi mandi gajar / twist: Avika at the door with halwa in a pressure cooker / button: 8:45 pm, Bas paanch minute! again",
